{"3541140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BattleSail", "steam_appid": 3541140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a pirate legend and build a fleet worthy of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own style of war on the open seas and oceans against other pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ships, level up your captains, unlock devastating abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase treasure, discover mysterious islands, and step into a pirate adventure filled with danger, wonder, and ambition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes - Campaign, Arenas, Puzzles, Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign - fight through a story-driven pirate adventure - 30 handcrafted levels across 5 missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arenas - quick play use fully equipped ships in short or long battles - 10 arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles - think twice before any turn and squeeze you brain a bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer - bring friends together for pirate battles on one PC or online - lots of arenas for shared fun and rivalry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Character - Captivating story leader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign game begins with choosing your own character - a captain whose destiny is in your hands and who will accompany you throughout the entire campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet - 30+ kinds of ships and four battle classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships differ not only in size - <strong>four distinct size classes</strong>, from small boats to massive warships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose between ships specialized in <strong>speed, offense, defense, or repairs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades - improve your ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the hull, armor, firing accuracy, maneuverability, or hire specialized crews that push your ship’s capabilities even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arsenal - 10+cannons and special ammunitions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small deck-mounted falconets to massive <strong>Long Nine cannons</strong>, floating mines with different effects, and special ammunition including fire<strong>, chain, and explosive shots</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities - unlock dozens of abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship class has its own unique set of abilities: vanish in a cloud of smoke, repair damage, protect allies, or unleash devastating weapons of mass destruction like <strong>mortars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captains - power to your battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire captains of varying levels, each granting unique bonuses to your ships and also accompany you in battle with their humor and advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment - huge oceans, beautiful landscapes, mystery islands</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In various environments - you will fight not only against your enemies, but you will deal with nature itself - Navigate through huge oceans, dense kelp fields, sharp reefs, sharpened stakes near native villages, treacherous whirlpools, and other natural hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Customization - custom sail, emblems, flags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your fleet the most beautiful on the seas. Spend diamonds to unlock colorful sails, emblems, flags, and other cosmetic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt - chests, gold, diamonds, ancient artefacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level may hide a valuable chest filled with precious gems. You will also collect fragments of ancient maps - once assembled, they lead to <strong>Treasure Islands</strong> hiding artifacts of immense value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/3d1a03742717b3565844cc869bbf25ad.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/3d1a03742717b3565844cc869bbf25ad.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/3d1a03742717b3565844cc869bbf25ad.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based action strategy with deep and highly variable combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Caribbean setting with huge oceans inspired by the Golden Age of Piracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes: story campaign and standalone content (arenas, puzzles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heroic pirate tale full of rises, falls, and triumph</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly original naval battles shaped by ship builds and player strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive ship customization: sails, colors, emblems, flags, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep progression systems: ship sizes, classes, upgrades, abilities, arsenal, captains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but rewarding economy: win battles → earn gold → build stronger fleets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental gameplay elements: volcanoes, kelp fields, reefs, whirlpools, deep colour changing oceans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure hunting based on ancient maps and legendary artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a pirate legend and build a fleet worthy of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own style of war on the open seas and oceans against other pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ships, level up your captains, unlock devastating abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase treasure, discover mysterious islands, and step into a pirate adventure filled with danger, wonder, and ambition.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes - Campaign, Arenas, Puzzles, Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign - fight through a story-driven pirate adventure - 30 handcrafted levels across 5 missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arenas - quick play use fully equipped ships in short or long battles - 10 arenas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles - think twice before any turn and squeeze you brain a bit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer - bring friends together for pirate battles on one PC or online - lots of arenas for shared fun and rivalry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Character - Captivating story leader</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign game begins with choosing your own character - a captain whose destiny is in your hands and who will accompany you throughout the entire campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/a6e4d121353f6b24546269582c0e2f0f.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fleet - 30+ kinds of ships and four battle classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ships differ not only in size - <strong>four distinct size classes</strong>, from small boats to massive warships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose between ships specialized in <strong>speed, offense, defense, or repairs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/baeb8863737106e4a17ba80255a7821f.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades - improve your ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the hull, armor, firing accuracy, maneuverability, or hire specialized crews that push your ship’s capabilities even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/8c4ee09a86068305931bbc8e8e6bad0b.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arsenal - 10+cannons and special ammunitions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From small deck-mounted falconets to massive <strong>Long Nine cannons</strong>, floating mines with different effects, and special ammunition including fire<strong>, chain, and explosive shots</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/7b964baac417ab10b81c66066aca3a79.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities - unlock dozens of abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship class has its own unique set of abilities: vanish in a cloud of smoke, repair damage, protect allies, or unleash devastating weapons of mass destruction like <strong>mortars</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/580ff622a07fab87ae2b315cb58aa807.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Captains - power to your battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hire captains of varying levels, each granting unique bonuses to your ships and also accompany you in battle with their humor and advice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/c0914a5184acd19be23e364b6a39a5e3.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environment - huge oceans, beautiful landscapes, mystery islands</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In various environments - you will fight not only against your enemies, but you will deal with nature itself - Navigate through huge oceans, dense kelp fields, sharp reefs, sharpened stakes near native villages, treacherous whirlpools, and other natural hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/2d65d8b312990ad020479913a903a54c.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ship Customization - custom sail, emblems, flags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your fleet the most beautiful on the seas. Spend diamonds to unlock colorful sails, emblems, flags, and other cosmetic upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/9e0821516ee414cdefe8e77aa1b9368d.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt - chests, gold, diamonds, ancient artefacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level may hide a valuable chest filled with precious gems. You will also collect fragments of ancient maps - once assembled, they lead to <strong>Treasure Islands</strong> hiding artifacts of immense value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/3d1a03742717b3565844cc869bbf25ad.poster.avif?t=1779875440\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/3d1a03742717b3565844cc869bbf25ad.webm?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/extras/3d1a03742717b3565844cc869bbf25ad.mp4?t=1779875440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based action strategy with deep and highly variable combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning Caribbean setting with huge oceans inspired by the Golden Age of Piracy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes: story campaign and standalone content (arenas, puzzles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heroic pirate tale full of rises, falls, and triumph</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly original naval battles shaped by ship builds and player strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive ship customization: sails, colors, emblems, flags, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep progression systems: ship sizes, classes, upgrades, abilities, arsenal, captains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but rewarding economy: win battles → earn gold → build stronger fleets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental gameplay elements: volcanoes, kelp fields, reefs, whirlpools, deep colour changing oceans</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure hunting based on ancient maps and legendary artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Fight pirate ships in turn-based naval battles during the Golden Age of Piracy. Earn gold, hunt hidden treasures, lead your fleet through a story campaign, and challenge friends in local and online multiplayer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Italian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Indonesian, Korean, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/d77bb560b320ee0d3636af71ee897f431f5bb56a/header.jpg?t=1779875440", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/4b0a68401bc07f50e703970f8f46c2e9ca783adb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779875440", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541140/4b0a68401bc07f50e703970f8f46c2e9ca783adb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779875440", "website": "https://battlesail.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> ryzen 7 5700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nvidia rtx 4070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available